                {
                  "klass": "Comment",
                  "text": "Here, we're setting the base appearance of the player.\n\nThe system will then seek the player_m files for the male \ncharacter and the player_f for the female character.\n\nYou can check how the files names are formated in the \nfolder:graphics/characters"
                },
                {
                  "klass": "Script",
                  "code": "$game_player.set_appearance_set('player')"
                },
                {
                  "klass": "ShowMessage",
                  "text": "2, 9 :[name=Professeur Ednid]:Je vois c'est bien ce qu'il me semblait !"
                },
                {
                  "klass": "ShowMessage",
                  "text": "2, 10 :[name=Professeur Ednid]:J'aimerais que tu me rappelles quel est ton nom ?"
