            {
              "klass": "FadeOutBGM",
              "seconds": 1
            },
            {
              "klass": "Comment",
              "text": "!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\nDelete the 4 next commands to have a teleportation\nwithout issues!\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
            },
            {
              "klass": "SetMoveRoute",
              "target": -1,
              "route": {
                "repeat": false,
                "skippable": false,
                "commands": [
                  {
                    "code": 42,
                    "parameters": [
                      0
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "klass": "Comment",
              "text": "Here, we're defining the items and the TM shops on the3\nExterior map"
            },
            {
              "klass": "Script",
              "code": "add_limited_shop(:shop_items, [:choice_scarf, :rocky_helmet, :king_s_rock, :life_orb, :focus_sash, :intriguing_stone], [1, 1, 1, 1, 1], shop_rewrite: false)\nadd_limited_shop(:shop_tms, [:tm06, :tm26, :tm55, :tm83], [1, 1, 1, 1], shop_rewrite: false)"
            },
            {
              "klass": "Comment",
              "text": "Here we're defining the limited shop of the Farmer NPC on\nthe Exterior map. The shop will have one unit of each\nPokémon (level 25) listed here: \nMiltank, Mareep, Tauros, Purrloin, Farfetch'd"
            },
            {
              "klass": "Script",
              "code": "PFM.game_state.shop.create_new_pokemon_shop(:farmer_shop, [:miltank], [3500], [25])\nPFM.game_state.shop.refill_pokemon_shop(:farmer_shop, [:mareep], list_price = [2500], list_param = [25])\nPFM.game_state.shop.refill_pokemon_shop(:farmer_shop, [:tauros], list_price = [4000], list_param = [25])\nPFM.game_state.shop.refill_pokemon_shop(:farmer_shop, [:purrloin], list_price = [1500], list_param = [25])\nPFM.game_state.shop.refill_pokemon_shop(:farmer_shop, [:farfetch_d], list_price = [3000], list_param = [25])"
            },
            {
              "klass": "Comment",
              "text": "We initialize, on the map 19 (Exterior),  the Berry plants for \nthe events with ID 12 and 13 and giving those an \nOran Berry and a Sitrus Berry respectively.\nThe \"3\" on the second command means the berry begins\nat the stage 3 out of 4, so only the Oran berry will be ready\nat the beginning of the game."
            },
            {
              "klass": "Script",
              "code": "Yuki::Berries.init_berry(38, 14, :oran_berry, 4)\nYuki::Berries.init_berry(38, 16, :cheri_berry, 4)\nYuki::Berries.init_berry(25, 1, :mepo_berry, 4)\nYuki::Berries.init_berry(25, 1, :oran_berry, 4)\nYuki::Berries.init_berry(28, 1, :chesto_berry, 4)"
            },
            {
              "klass": "Wait",
              "frames": 30
            },
            {
              "klass": "Comment",
              "text": "!!!IMPORTANT, PLEASE READ!!!\nThis event lowers the opacity of the player and display\na white image to give the illusion of a flash happening\nand to let the player \"exit\" the ship. You might want to\ndelete these commands to ensure you'll have a proper\nteleportation! (search a comment beginning with !!!!!!!!)"
            },
